  metric             quarter   channel    region  customer  category       sku
  revenue               adds      adds      adds      adds      adds      adds
  gross_profit          adds      adds      adds      adds      adds      adds
  margin_pct               ·         ·         ·         ·         ·         ·
  orders                adds      adds      adds      adds         ·         ·
  units                 adds      adds      adds      adds      adds      adds
  skus                     ·         ·         ·         ·      adds      adds
  cost                  adds      adds      adds      adds      adds      adds
  avg_discount             ·         ·         ·         ·         ·         ·
  avg_order_value          ·         ·         ·         ·         ·         ·

where a distinct count adds up, and why:
  orders by quarter   adds       most quarter values in one order: 1
  orders by channel   adds       most channel values in one order: 1
  orders by region    adds       most region values in one order: 1
  orders by customer  adds       most customer values in one order: 1
